  "note": {
    "title": "Book club: Parfit's teletransporter, and the bat paper next",
    "content": "",
    "note_type": "meeting",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-1",
        "text": "Okay, book club. Parfit on personal identity, from Reasons and Persons.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945003406,
        "startMs": 3406,
        "endMs": 8905,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-2",
        "text": "Right. Personal identity and the teletransporter. I argued with Parfit on personal identity the whole way.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945010482,
        "startMs": 10482,
        "endMs": 18898,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dev",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-3",
        "text": "The teletransporter is the famous personal identity case. A copy of you on Mars, and the original destroyed on Earth.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945020353,
        "startMs": 20353,
        "endMs": 29606,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Hanne",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-4",
        "text": "And Parfit says personal identity is not the thing that matters. Psychological continuity is.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945030990,
        "startMs": 30990,
        "endMs": 37740,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-5",
        "text": "Would you use the teletransporter?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945039386,
        "startMs": 39386,
        "endMs": 42191,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dev",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-6",
        "text": "Never. I'd take the train.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945043122,
        "startMs": 43122,
        "endMs": 45619,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Hanne",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-7",
        "text": "Same. The copy on Mars has my memories, but the copy isn't me.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945046541,
        "startMs": 46541,
        "endMs": 53409,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dev",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-8",
        "text": "Then fission, the other personal identity case. Each half of your brain survives in a different body.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945054743,
        "startMs": 54743,
        "endMs": 62975,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-9",
        "text": "Fission is the personal identity case that got me. Identity can't go to both halves, and neither half has a better claim.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945063782,
        "startMs": 63782,
        "endMs": 73923,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Hanne",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-10",
        "text": "Parfit said the view made him care less about his own future, and more about other people.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945075008,
        "startMs": 75008,
        "endMs": 83196,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-11",
        "text": "That's the part of personal identity I liked. Less self, more everyone else.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945084504,
        "startMs": 84504,
        "endMs": 91689,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dev",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-12",
        "text": "Next month, then. Nagel's bat paper.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945092532,
        "startMs": 92532,
        "endMs": 95582,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Hanne",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-13",
        "text": "Right, Nagel's bat paper. The bat paper on conscious experience, from 1974.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945096286,
        "startMs": 96286,
        "endMs": 102319,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-14",
        "text": "Is the bat paper long?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945102995,
        "startMs": 102995,
        "endMs": 105817,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dev",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-15",
        "text": "Short, one evening's reading.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945106562,
        "startMs": 106562,
        "endMs": 108690,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Lucia",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-16",
        "text": "Good. One evening of the bat paper, and wine.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791945109923,
        "startMs": 109923,
        "endMs": 114044,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Hanne",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-mv7hq89k-17",
        "text": "Can we do the bat paper at my place?",
        "source": "mic",
